graph TD
    A[Images + YOLO Labels] --> B[SegmentationDataset<br/>Polygon → Binary Mask<br/>Resize 518x518]
    B --> C[DataLoader<br/>DistributedSampler<br/>batch_size=2]

    C --> D[StudentObjMask.forward]

    D --> E[StudentAggregator<br/>Frozen, no_grad]
    E --> F[ObjMaskDecoder<br/>Feature Pyramid + SegFormer]
    F --> G[Logits<br/>B, 2, 518, 518]

    G --> H[CrossEntropy Loss]
    G --> I[Dice Loss]
    H --> J[Combined Loss<br/>CE + Dice]
    I --> J

    J --> K[loss.backward]
    K --> L[Gradient Clip<br/>max_norm=1.0]
    L --> M[optimizer.step<br/>AdamW]
    M --> N[scheduler.step<br/>Warmup + Cosine]

    N --> O{End of Epoch?}
    O -->|No| C
    O -->|Yes| P[Validate<br/>mIoU, Dice, Pixel Acc]

    P --> Q{Best mIoU?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Save Best Checkpoint<br/>Reset Patience]
    Q -->|No| S[Increment Patience]

    S --> T{Patience >= 15?}
    T -->|Yes| U[Early Stop]
    T -->|No| C

    R --> C
